        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 22:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho MUKAMA Ruhanga yagamba ati: “Habwokuba omuntu afookere nk'omu hali itwe, naamanya oburungi n'obubi, kandi hati taikara kunoga ebijuma eby'omuti ogunyakwomeeza akabirya, akoomeera ebiro byona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahabweki MUKAMA Ruhanga yamwiha omu rugonjo rwa Edeni, agende alime itaka eri yaihirwemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabingamu omusaija ogu; ha Buturukaizooba obw'orugonjo orw'Edeni, yatayo bakerubbi n'empirima erukumyalikya kulinda omuhanda ogurukugenda ha muti ogunyakwomeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
